INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771378372782', 'Serato DJ Pro Suite 4.0.2', 'Serato DJ Pro Overview Serato DJ Pro is a leading software solution for professional DJs and music enthusiasts. With its comprehensive features and intuitive interface, Serato DJ Pro revolutionizes the art of DJing, offering advanced tools for mixing, blending, and manipulating music. In this article, we will explore the remarkable features, benefits, and applications of Serato DJ Pro, shedding light on how this software empowers DJs to take their performances to new heights and deliver unforgettable experiences to their audiences.  Unleashing the Power of Serato DJ Pro: Serato DJ Pro is a comprehensive software solution that empowers DJs to unleash their creativity and elevate their performances. With its powerful features, seamless integration with hardware, and intuitive interface, Serato DJ Pro sets the standard for professional DJ software. Whether you''re a beginner or a seasoned pro, Serato DJ Pro provides the tools and functionality needed to create unique mixes and engage with', 850, 'Software', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771536830070', '100W Tear-Resistant Durability C to C Cable OCD-1525CC', 'Model: OCD-1525CC (BraidLine) Type: USB-C to USB-C Charging Power: 100W (Max), 5A Data Transfer Speed: 480 Mbps Length: 1 Meter Durability: Tear-resistant braided material Fast Charging Protocols: PD3.0 & QC3.0 compatible   This cable is designed for high-power,, long-lasting use, capable of charging demanding devices like laptops, ensuring both speed and structural integrity during daily use', 500, 'Cables', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771378555132', 'Serato DJ Pro Suite 4.0.0', 'Overview of Serato DJ Pro Suite for macOS If you''re a professional DJ looking for the best software to enhance your performances, look no further than Serato DJ Suite for macOS. This powerful software, developed by Serato, is packed with features that will take your DJ skills to the next level.  Features of Serato DJ Pro Suite for macOS Enhanced DJ tools: The Serato DJ Suite includes a range of advanced DJ tools, such as beatmatching, looping, and syncing, to help you create seamless mixes Advanced audio effects: The software comes with a range of audio effects, including echo, reverb, and delay, to help you add an extra flair to your sets DJ performance modes: The Serato DJ Suite includes several performance modes, including Slip Mode and Serato Flip, to help you add creative touches to your sets Expansive library: The software allows you to access a vast library of tracks and beats, so you''ll always have a wide range of music to choose from for your sets DJ hardware integration: Th', 850, 'Software', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771378781342', 'Pioneer DJ Rekordbox 6.8.4', 'Overview of Pioneer DJ Rekordbox Premium Rekordbox DJ''s GUI is perfectly matched with the layout of your hardware no matter what player or device you are using, including the new DDJ-RR and DDJ-RB. It''s simply the most effortless, intuitive software imaginable.  The FX, waveform, players, sampler, and browser mirror your hardware exactly, and you can choose from a 2/4 deck with horizontal or vertical views. Hot Cues, Sampler, and other effects offer intuitive operation to match the same layout as the pad control section in our DJ controller.  You can easily mix your playlist with confidence and accuracy. An all-new phrase analysis algorithm detects track phrases in Rekordbox''s KORETECH engine. In addition, Automix uses track information, such as beat position, BPM, and key, to produce natural mixes. You are free to scratch, apply FX, and change the order of tracks whenever you want.  Features of Pioneer DJ Rekordbox Premium  Professional sound quality Lowest latency in the business ', 700, 'Software', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379048760', 'Pioneer DJ rekordbox 5.8.6.0004 Premium', 'Overview of Pioneer DJ rekordbox It''s a worldwide database solution for organizing playlists and music that works with all of our devices, whether you''re utilizing multi-players, DJ controllers, or a DVS setup. With this program, you can now bring your entire music library to the club on an SD or USB device, plug it in, and play.  They re-examined the audio, graphic, and video signal processing program to develop KORETECH. This next-generation engine makes rekordbox a more lightweight and stable application with great features and performance. Furthermore, the improved USB/SD export function makes managing your music library even easier than before.  It also has a new user interface with a logical architecture that makes it simple to manage your music collection and perform intuitively with the rekordbox DJ, DVS, and video Plus Packs.  Features of Pioneer DJ rekordbox Improved core for light and stable performance Advanced and accurate track analysis Improved USB/SD export features N', 700, 'Software', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379228011', 'Atomix VirtualDJ 2025 Pro Infinity 8.5.8472', 'Atomix VirtualDJ Pro Infinity Overview DJs use VirtualDJ to replace their turntables and CD players and use digital music instead of vinyl and CDs. Virtual DJ is compatible with time-coded pieces of vinyl that let you scratch your MP3s directly on an absolute turntable and with many other DJ equipment, save for each song and an extensive collection of excellent automatically synchronized effects. Virtual DJ Pro Infinity has more functionality and lets you do new things that were only possible on DJ software, from scratching video clips to producing complex remixes.  Atomix VirtualDJ Pro (better known as VirtualDJ Pro or Virtual DJ Pro) has been used by millions of DJs and hobbies to replace traditional tools and make their mixes incredibly fast. In addition, the Infinity version lets them add an unlimited number of cue points and save for each song automatically beat-synchronized effects.  Features of Atomix Virtual DJ Pro Infinity Play an unlimited number of samples simultaneously. Mi', 700, 'Software', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379464556', 'MAGIX ACID Pro 11.0.2.21', 'Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Benefits It is a powerful 64-bit DAW that features ACID''s famous innovative audio looping technology, powerful multitrack recording, and hi-end audio and MIDI features - all set within an easy-to-use interface to help artists of all levels bring their musical aspirations into reality.  This new version introduces a new GUI but the same famous workflow, creating an exciting and creative music production environment: 64-bit processing, no less than 16 new instruments, 13 new effect plug-ins, and 9 GB of new ACIDized loops. Plus, VST3 support is coming soon in a free update giving you access to thousands of third-party plug-ins.  Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Features The creative DAW for sample- and loop-based music production NEW! ACID Morph Pads Celemony Melodyne essential NEW! Sidechaining NEW! Transient detection in the MIDI Playable Chopper Remix Tool NEW! Instruments, effects, and ACIDized loops Technical Details and System Requirements Windows 10, Windows ', 500, 'Software', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379681819', 'MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite 1.0.3.32 64-bit version', 'Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite Benefits With a worlds first for any DAW, ACID Pro Next combines cutting edge sampling technology, a fully featured DAW and unique ACIDized loops that lock in time and key with your new compositions. To show you everything that ACID Pro Next has to offer, we sat down together with producer Iain Duncan in our studio.  Only the ACID Pro Next Suite comes with additional bonus instruments and add-ons. Also included: The incredible Independence Pro Plus Suite with 12 GB of sounds and 500 presets, 10 exclusive Vita instruments (including Power Guitar, Bass Machine and String Ensemble), 9 exclusive effects (including Vandal guitar-effects and the Vintage Effects Suite), plus two extra bundles of ACID loops for Funky House and 80s Hip Hop.  It delivers all the effects you need for the perfect mixing experience and also offers very flexible mastering solutions. Premium professional effect plug-ins include the Analogue Modelling Suite, the Vintage Effects Su', 500, 'Software', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771379819628', 'MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite 1.0.3.32 32-bit version', 'Overview of MAGIX ACID Pro Next Suite Benefits With a worlds first for any DAW, ACID Pro Next combines cutting edge sampling technology, a fully featured DAW and unique ACIDized loops that lock in time and key with your new compositions. To show you everything that ACID Pro Next has to offer, we sat down together with producer Iain Duncan in our studio.  Only the ACID Pro Next Suite comes with additional bonus instruments and add-ons. Also included: The incredible Independence Pro Plus Suite with 12 GB of sounds and 500 presets, 10 exclusive Vita instruments (including Power Guitar, Bass Machine and String Ensemble), 9 exclusive effects (including Vandal guitar-effects and the Vintage Effects Suite), plus two extra bundles of ACID loops for Funky House and 80s Hip Hop.  It delivers all the effects you need for the perfect mixing experience and also offers very flexible mastering solutions. Premium professional effect plug-ins include the Analogue Modelling Suite, the Vintage Effects Su', 500, 'Software', '', 1);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO products (id, name, description, price, category, image, is_active) VALUES ('p1771380022611', 'MAGIX VEGAS Pro 23.0.0.356', 'Overview of MAGIX Vegas Pro  VEGAS Pro is the Creative Software from MAGIX Corporation for Professional Video, Audio, and Blue-ray Disc Creating! Only Vegas combines real-time SD, HD, 2K, and 4K video editing with unrivaled audio tools to provide the ultimate all-in-one environment for creative professionals. High-definition and high-fidelity.  VEGAS Pro gives you more editing power than ever before. With new velocity limits, you can create a fast motion that’s 40 times faster than the average speed. New hover scrub capabilities make marking in and out points and adding footage from the Trimmer much faster and more efficient. That leaves more time for your main goal: creating impressive videos.  Make complete HD recordings stand out in top quality with intelligent plug-ins, even in 4K projects. Incorporate your HD archival footage in 4K projects with Smart Upscaling and Smart Zoom tools. Deliver your project in a variety of standard 4K file formats.  Features of MAGIX Vegas Pro Innovat', 500, 'Software', '', 1);
